v 3
d 'ddd': Triple Differences (DDD) estimators
d
d Implements the regression-adjustment (RA), inverse-probability-weighting (IPW),
d and doubly-robust (DR) estimators of group-time average treatment effects
d ATT(g,t) in triple-differences designs, following Ortiz-Villavicencio and
d Sant'Anna (2025), arXiv:2505.09942.
d
d Key point: the DR DDD is a function of THREE DiD comparisons, not two;
d common "three-way fixed effects" and "difference of two DiDs" implementations
d are invalid when covariates matter.
d
d Author: Haoyu Niu
d Distribution-Date: 20261010
d Version: 0.3.0
d Requires: Stata version 16
